; WHDLoadWrapper-Switch - C:WHDLoad is either the wrapper or the plain WHDLoad
FailAt 21
If NOT EXISTS C:WHDLoadWrapper
  RequestChoice >NIL: "WHDLoad wrapper" "C:WHDLoadWrapper is missing.*NThe wrapper package is not installed." "OK"
  Quit
EndIf
If NOT EXISTS C:WHDLoad.ori
  RequestChoice >NIL: "WHDLoad wrapper" "C:WHDLoad.ori is missing.*NCopy the plain WHDLoad there first." "OK"
  Quit
EndIf
Version >ENV:HatcherWHDLoad C:WHDLoad
Search >NIL: ENV:HatcherWHDLoad WHDLoadWrapper QUIET
If WARN
  RequestChoice >ENV:HatcherWHDAnswer "WHDLoad wrapper" "The WHDLoad wrapper is off.*NGames start with the plain WHDLoad.*N*NSwitch the wrapper on?" "Switch on|Cancel"
  If $HatcherWHDAnswer EQ 1
    Copy C:WHDLoadWrapper C:WHDLoad CLONE QUIET
    If FAIL
      RequestChoice >NIL: "WHDLoad wrapper" "Copying C:WHDLoadWrapper to C:WHDLoad failed.*NNothing changed." "OK"
    Else
      RequestChoice >NIL: "WHDLoad wrapper" "The WHDLoad wrapper is on.*NIt sets EmuControl before every game." "OK"
    EndIf
  EndIf
Else
  RequestChoice >ENV:HatcherWHDAnswer "WHDLoad wrapper" "The WHDLoad wrapper is on.*NIt sets EmuControl before every game.*N*NSwitch the wrapper off?" "Switch off|Cancel"
  If $HatcherWHDAnswer EQ 1
    Copy C:WHDLoad.ori C:WHDLoad CLONE QUIET
    If FAIL
      RequestChoice >NIL: "WHDLoad wrapper" "Copying C:WHDLoad.ori to C:WHDLoad failed.*NNothing changed." "OK"
    Else
      RequestChoice >NIL: "WHDLoad wrapper" "The WHDLoad wrapper is off.*NGames start with the plain WHDLoad." "OK"
    EndIf
  EndIf
EndIf
Delete >NIL: ENV:HatcherWHDLoad ENV:HatcherWHDAnswer QUIET
